	(descr "Acconeer XM125 Entry+ radar module, 28-pad LGA 18.6 x 15 mm, land pattern per XM125 datasheet v1.2 Fig 6.3 (pads 0.95 x 2.40, pitch 1.27, outer 16.89 / inner 12.09 mm, row span 17.46 mm). Pin numbering per Fig 2.3 (pin 1 bottom-left, top view). Body assumed centred on the pad field (SparkFun XM125.lbr agrees). A121 outline on F.Fab at datasheet Fig 6.1 position. Radiates broadside from the module top (component side, away from the host PCB).")
